msgid "CONTROL_HELP"
msgstr "What this does"

msgid "TOUCH_HELP"
msgstr "Hold an action button for a moment to see what it does. Move your finger to scroll instead. With a mouse, hover for a hint; with a keyboard, focus a control and press F1."

msgid "PLAYER_SHORTCUTS"
msgstr "Space always plays or pauses while a menu is closed. Left and Right move by measure, or turn a reading page. Focus the position scrubber for beat-by-beat Arrow keys, Page Up/Down by measure, and Home/End. Escape closes a menu or capture view. F8 toggles capture view. Tab moves between controls. Swipe across a manual reading page to turn it. Piano keys are listed below."

msgid "TIP_MENU"
msgstr "Open music, playback, printing and appearance options."

msgid "TIP_PLAY"
msgstr "Play or pause at the current position. Space does the same. Count-in and speed are in Playback."

msgid "TIP_STOP"
msgstr "Stop and return to the beginning of the song or selected loop."

msgid "TIP_TEMPO"
msgstr "Drag the speed slider to find a comfortable pace. Open Playback for an exact BPM, count-in and more options."

msgid "TIP_SCORE_VIEW"
msgstr "Choose scrolling, manual pages or automatic page turns. Print or review the arrangement here."

msgid "TIP_PRINT"
msgstr "Create a printable file of the selected part. Choose tabs, sheet music or both; then open the saved file to print or save as PDF."

msgid "TIP_CLOSE"
msgstr "Close this menu and return to your music."

msgid "REDUCED_MOTION"
msgstr "Reduce motion"

msgid "MOTION_SYSTEM"
msgstr "Following your device setting. Decorative effects are off when motion is reduced. Choose pages in Score view for a stationary score."

msgid "MOTION_OVERRIDE"
msgstr "Saved on this device. Reduced motion disables decorative effects. Choose pages in Score view for a stationary score."

msgid "MOTION_FOLLOW"
